{"4416830": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BATTLEDRIFT", "steam_appid": 4416830, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416830/extras/0134ac0203efad8c38c1f2734d89dd00.poster.avif?t=1788325585\" width=910 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416830/extras/0134ac0203efad8c38c1f2734d89dd00.webm?t=1788325585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416830/extras/0134ac0203efad8c38c1f2734d89dd00.mp4?t=1788325585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>BATTLEDRIFT - 4 Player Battle in Space</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ship is stranded in a warzone and is completely out of fuel! You'll have to use your ample artillery as propulsion. Use your own gun recoil to push yourself around as you face off against each other with up to 4 human or CPU players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416830/extras/5911fb29a9118adbc2e2931d80eb12cf.poster.avif?t=1788325585\" width=960 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416830/extras/5911fb29a9118adbc2e2931d80eb12cf.webm?t=1788325585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416830/extras/5911fb29a9118adbc2e2931d80eb12cf.mp4?t=1788325585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>Play your way - 3 Bullet Types</strong></u></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Laser</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416830/extras/51de922e37c2cb6d5149c948ecdf4587.poster.avif?t=1788325585\" width=400 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416830/extras/51de922e37c2cb6d5149c948ecdf4587.webm?t=1788325585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416830/extras/51de922e37c2cb6d5149c948ecdf4587.mp4?t=1788325585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets travel faster and can block each other</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ghost</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416830/extras/7ecc4563b97490ae28ecdf2526258c93.poster.avif?t=1788325585\" width=400 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416830/extras/7ecc4563b97490ae28ecdf2526258c93.webm?t=1788325585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416830/extras/7ecc4563b97490ae28ecdf2526258c93.mp4?t=1788325585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets can pass through each other</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rubber</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416830/extras/d25fedbd7cbd8189444fb8dc65ed67ac.poster.avif?t=1788325585\" width=400 height=124 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416830/extras/d25fedbd7cbd8189444fb8dc65ed67ac.webm?t=1788325585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416830/extras/d25fedbd7cbd8189444fb8dc65ed67ac.mp4?t=1788325585\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bullets bounce off of everything for maximum chaos!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Game Features:</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single player with multiple levels of CPU difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Local multiplayer with up to 4 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three different bullet types for extra variety - try them all!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ghost - Bullets pass through everything except enemy ships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Laser - Like ghost, but bullets can block other bullets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rubber - Ship velocity affects bullet velocity, bullets bounce off of everything for maximum chaos!</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for both gamepad and keyboard (3-4 players on keyboard depending on keyboard size).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, all menus and gameplay are accessible using only the 4 arrows keys (and the ESC key for pausing).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Levels in the demo, 10 levels planned for the full release!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416830/extras/0134ac0203efad8c38c1f2734d89dd00.poster.avif?t=1788325585\" width=910 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4416830/extras/0134ac0203efad8c38c1f2734d89dd00.webm?t=1788325585\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_ass